package main

templ Tidewater(){
    <div>
        <div>
            44 Tidewater Drive; 10 years on. 
            </div>

            <div>
            Ten years ago we were looking for a picnic spot and discovered the For Sale sign on 44 Tidewater from outside. It seemed like a roughcast house, an impenetrable front fence, dominating 2m wide macrocarpa hedges on the north and south boundaries and a generous bracken rough cast front garage. While it was obviously going to be a lot of blood, sweat and tears to make something in the front of the property, we like the rural setting and the moody bay in front of us.
        </div>
    </div>
}